l showed no price. Keep just name and Free Shipping badge. Button Add to Cart.\n\nProduct 13 out of stock: button \"Out of Stock\" disabled.\n\nCustom section: h4 \"CUSTOMIZE YOUR PROPS\", link \"Learn About Our Screen Printing Capabilities\".\n\nAbout: h3 + paragraph (copy from original).\n\nTestimonials: 3 quotes.\n1. \"We outfit our entire studio with YogaDirect mats and bolsters. The quality is outstanding and the quantity pricing saves us hundreds every year.\" — Maya R., Studio Owner, Austin TX\n2. \"The 1/4 inch mat is the best value I've found in 10 years of practice. Fast shipping, too.\" — Daniel K., Yoga Teacher\n3. \"Ordered blankets and blocks for our teacher training — everything arrived quickly and the students love them.\" — Priya S., RYT-500\n\nNewsletter: h2 \"Get 10% Off Your First Order\", p \"Join our list for exclusive deals, new product alerts, and yoga tips.\", form email + \"Claim My 10% Off\".\n\nFooter: columns: Shop (Yoga Mats, Bolsters, Blankets, Props, Clothing, Sale), Company (About/Contact, Custom Printing, Rewards Program, Quantity Discounts, Gift Cards), Account (My Account, Contact Us). Copyright: \"© YogaDirect.com — Serving the yoga community since 1999.\"\n\nNow, improvements list at the end with What/Why/Hash, using the exact strings hashed.\n\nShould the class also be applied on changed elements — yes. For improvement 4, the buttons changed from \"Select Options\" to \"Add to Cart\" — each button gets HDLmClassA007A269. For improvement 3, badges and ratings get HDLmClass7807E5C6.\n\nOne more check — \"Copy everything from the old HTML\": I'll retain promo bar, categories, featured products with all 16, custom printing section, about section, nav links. Good.\n\nLength is fine. Let me write the final answer: complete HTML + improvements list.\n\nAlso note assumption: original HTML couldn't be fully retrieved so I reconstructed it faithfully from fetched content; mention briefly. Keep it professional.\n\nFormat: Use a heading, the HTML in a code block, then improvements as a numbered list with What/Why/Hash."}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":3545,"completion_tokens":48250,"total_tokens":51795,"cost":0.7336938,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":41252,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.7336938,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.0099438,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.72375},"server_tool_use_details":{"tool_calls_requested":1,"tool_calls_executed":1}}}
