class=\\\"old\\\">$16.99</span>$12.99</div>\\n        <a href=\\\"/products/foam-yoga-block-2-pack\\\" class=\\\"btn-cart\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n        <h3>8' Cotton Yoga Strap</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734; (764)</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\"><span class=\\\"old\\\">$9.99</span>$7.49</div>\\n        <a href=\\\"/products/cotton-yoga-strap\\\" class=\\\"btn-cart\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n        <h3>Zafu Meditation Cushion</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; (541)</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\"><span class=\\\"old\\\">$44.99</span>$34.99</div>\\n        <a href=\\\"/products/zafu-meditation-cushion\\\" class=\\\"btn-cart\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"section about\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"container HDLmClassc8c117d5\\\">\\n    <h2>Why Shop YogaDirect?</h2>\\n    <p>Since 1999, YogaDirect has grown into one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. Because we manufacture and source our own goods, we deliver consistently high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices &mdash; helping you grow your studio, event, or personal practice.</p>\\n    <p>When you shop with us, you support the entire Yoga community. From our team of Yoga lovers to you &mdash; thank you.</p>\\n    <a href=\\\"/collections/all\\\" class=\\\"btn-primary\\\">Shop the Full Collection</a>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"section testimonials\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"container HDLmClass4a377767\\\">\\n    <h2>What Our Customers Say</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"sub\\\">Join thousands of studios and yogis who trust YogaDirect.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"testimonial-grid\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"testimonial\\\">\\n        &quot;Outstanding quality at unbeatable prices. I outfitted my entire studio with YogaDirect mats and props.&quot;\\n        <span class=\\\"name\\\">&mdash; Sarah M., Studio Owner</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"testimonial\\\">\\n        &quot;Fast shipping and the extra thick mat is the most comfortable I have ever practiced on. Highly recommend!&quot;\\n        <span class=\\\"name\\\">&mdash; David R., Verified Buyer</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"testimonial\\\">\\n        &quot;I have been ordering from YogaDirect for over five years. Consistent quality and wonderful customer service.&quot;\\n        <span class=\\\"name\\\">&mdash; Priya K., Yoga Instructor</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"section newsletter HDLmClass9a74efeb\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <h2>Get 10% Off Your First Order</h2>\\n    <p>Join our newsletter for exclusive deals, new arrivals, and yoga tips delivered to your inbox.</p>\\n    <form action=\\\"/newsletter-signup\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n      <input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Enter your email address\\\" required>\\n      <button type=\\\"submit\\\">Claim My 10% Off</button>\\n    </form>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <p>&copy; 1999&ndash;2025 YogaDirect. Faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999.</p>\\n</footer>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\", \"improvements\": [{\"What\": \"Added a promotional announcement bar at the top of the page offering free shipping on orders over $75 and a 10% discount code\", \"Why\": \"Urgency and incentive banners at the top of e-commerce pages are proven to increase average order value and reduce cart abandonment by giving shoppers an immediate reason to buy now\", \"Hash\": \"HDLmClasse15d56a\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a hero section with a clear value proposition headline, supporting subheadline, and a prominent 'Shop Best Sellers' call-to-action button\", \"Why\": \"A strong above-the-fold hero with a single clear call-to-action focuses visitor attenti