ick, non-slip, and holds up great after months of daily use.\\\"</p><div class=\\\"author\\\">- Sarah M., Verified Buyer</div></div><div class=\\\"testimonial-card\\\"><div class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</div><p>\\\"Fast shipping and the cork block quality is amazing for the price. Highly recommend YogaDirect!\\\"</p><div class=\\\"author\\\">- James T., Verified Buyer</div></div><div class=\\\"testimonial-card\\\"><div class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★☆</div><p>\\\"Great bolster, very supportive for restorative yoga. Would buy again.\\\"</p><div class=\\\"author\\\">- Priya K., Verified Buyer</div></div><div class=\\\"testimonial-card\\\"><div class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</div><p>\\\"I've outfitted my entire studio with YogaDirect props. Customers love them and so do I.\\\"</p><div class=\\\"author\\\">- Studio Om, Verified Buyer</div></div></div></section><div class=\\\"trust-badges HDLmClass9c4f2a8\\\"><span>&#9733; 4.8/5 Average Rating from 2,300+ Reviews</span><span>&#128666; Free Shipping Over $50</span><span>&#128274; Secure Checkout</span></div><footer><p>&copy; 1999-2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</p></footer></body></html>\",\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Added a customer reviews/testimonials section featuring four customer quotes with 5-star (and one 4-star) rating displays and verified buyer labels\",\"Why\":\"Social proof from testimonials with star ratings builds trust and credibility, reduces purchase anxiety, and has been shown to significantly increase conversion rates by validating product quality through peer opinions\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass7e3d5c1\"},{\"What\":\"Added a trust badges bar showing aggregate star rating (4.8/5 from 2,300+ reviews), free shipping threshold, and secure checkout messaging near the testimonials section\",\"Why\":\"Surfacing an aggregate rating alongside individual testimonials reinforces overall trustworthiness at a glance and combining it with shipping and security assurances reduces friction and cart abandonment, increasing convers