ount incentive\",\"Why\":\"Capturing visitor emails with an immediate discount incentive builds a marketing list for remarketing and encourages first-time purchases, directly increasing conversion rate and repeat revenue.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass_51d2f6b7\"},{\"What\":\"Added a prominent hero section with a clear value proposition and call-to-action button linking to products\",\"Why\":\"A strong above-the-fold hero with a direct CTA reduces friction for visitors to find products quickly, improving click-through to the shop section and boosting conversions.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass_3f8a2c91\"},{\"What\":\"Added a trust bar highlighting free shipping threshold, secure checkout, money-back guarantee, and years in business\",\"Why\":\"Displaying trust signals near the top of the page reduces purchase anxiety and objections, which is proven to increase checkout completion rates.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass_7bce41a0\"},{\"What\":\"Added a featured products grid with images, prices, and Add to Cart buttons\",\"Why\":\"Showcasing bestselling products directly on the homepage with clear pricing and a low-friction add-to-cart action shortens the path to purchase and increases average order value opportunities.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass_9a1e7d44\"},{\"What\":\"Added a customer reviews/testimonials section with star ratings\",\"Why\":\"Social proof from real customer testimonials increases trust and credibility, which has a strong positive correlation with conversion rate improvements on ecommerce sites.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass_c2497e18\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":null}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":17169,"completion_tokens":4075,"total_tokens":21244,"cost":0.075088,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.075088,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.034338,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.04075},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"au