iv class=\\\"price\\\">$24.99</div>\\n      <a href=\\\"/product/4\\\" class=\\\"HDLmClass9b6f1d3a8c5e0247\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"HDLmClass2e7c4b9f105a3d68\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"trust-item\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"><path d=\\\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\\\"/></svg>Since 1999 &mdash; 25+ Years of Trust</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"trust-item\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"><rect x=\\\"1\\\" y=\\\"3\\\" width=\\\"15\\\" height=\\\"13\\\"/><path d=\\\"M16 8h4l3 3v5h-7V8z\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"5.5\\\" cy=\\\"18.5\\\" r=\\\"2.5\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"18.5\\\" cy=\\\"18.5\\\" r=\\\"2.5\\\"/></svg>Free Shipping Over $50</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"trust-item\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"><path d=\\\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\\\"/></svg>Manufacturer Direct Quality</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"trust-item\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"><circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"10\\\"/><path d=\\\"M12 6v6l4 2\\\"/></svg>Fast, Reliable Order Processing</div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about-section\\\">\\n  <h2 class=\\\"section-title\\\">Our Story</h2>\\n  <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <p>&copy; 2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved. | <a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Contact Us</a> | <a href=\\\"/returns\\\">Returns</a> | <a href=\\\"/privacy\\\">Privacy Policy</a></p>\\n</footer>\\n</body></html>\",\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Added a persistent header bar with search, account, and cart icons, including a visible cart item count badge, that stays fixed at the top of the page (position: sticky) as the user scrolls.\",\"Why\":\"Persistent access to search, account, and cart functions reduces friction for shoppers trying to find products, manage their profile, or complete checkout, which directly increases conversion rates. A visible cart count also creates urgency and reminds users of items already selected, reducing cart abandonment and boosting revenue.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass7f3a2b9c1e0d4f56\"},{\"What\":\"Added a dedicated search bar row beneath the top navigation with an input field and search button.\",\"Why\":\"An easily accessible, always-visible search bar helps customers quickly find specific yoga products, shortening the path to purchase and improving overall conversion.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass7f3a2b9c1e0d4f56\"},{\"What\":\"Introduced a promotional announcement bar above the header highlighting free shipping over $50.\",\"Why\":\"Prominently displaying a shipping incentive at the very top of the page increases average order value by encouraging customers to add more items to qualify, and builds trust before they even browse.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass5c2b9e0a417d6f38\"},{\"What\":\"Added a hero banner section with a clear headline, supporting subtext, and a prominent 'Shop Featured Products' call-to-action button.\",\"Why\":\"A strong above-the-fold hero with a clear CTA guides first-time visitors immediately toward shopping, improving click-through to product pages and reducing bounce rate.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass3d8e6a1f204b7c92\"},{\"What\":\"Styled the primary call-to-action button with a contrasting color, padding, shadow, and hover animation.\",\"Why\":\"High-contrast, visually prominent CTA buttons are proven to draw attention and increase click-through rates, directly supporting higher conversion.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClassa19c4f7e6b0d3852\"},{\"What\":\"Added a Featured Products grid with product images, names, prices, and individual 'Add to Cart' buttons.\",\"Why\":\"Showcasing featured products directly on the homepage with immediate add-to-cart actions shortens the purchase funnel and capitalizes on impulse buying behavior, increasing revenue per visit.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass9b6f1d3a8c5e0247\"},{\"What\":\"Added a trust-signal bar with icons and text covering brand history (since 1999), free shipping threshold, manufacturer-direct quality, and fast order processing.\",\"Why\":\"Trust signals reduce perceived purchase risk and address common customer objections up front, which increases buyer confidence and conversion rates.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass2e7c4b9f105a3d68\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":null}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":11246,"completion_tokens":5961,"total_tokens":17207,"cost":0.082102,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.082102,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.022492,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.05961},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0},"server_tool_use_details":{"web_search_requests":0}}}
