 we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p></section><section id=\\\"newsletter\\\" class=\\\"newsletter HDLmClass6e1d4a88\\\"><h2>Get 10% Off Your First Order</h2><p>Sign up for exclusive deals, new product launches, and yoga tips.</p><form><input type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Enter your email\\\" required><button type=\\\"submit\\\">Subscribe</button></form></section></main><footer><p>&copy; 2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</p></footer></body></html>\",\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Restructured the existing About Us text into a dedicated, styled section with a heading titled 'About YogaDirect', giving it a card-style container with padding, border, and centered typography.\",\"Why\":\"Presenting the About Us content in a visually distinct, well-organized section with a clear heading improves readability and builds trust and credibility with visitors, which can positively influence purchase decisions.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass1a6c9e73\"},{\"What\":\"Added a prominent hero section with a compelling headline, supporting subtext, and a primary call-to-action button ('Shop Best Sellers Now').\",\"Why\":\"A strong hero section with a clear CTA immediately directs visitor attention and encourages them to take the next step toward purchase, increasing conversion rates.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass9d4e6f21\"},{\"What\":\"Added a Featured Products section with product cards showing images, names, prices, and 'Add to Cart' buttons.\",\"Why\":\"Showcasing featured products directly on the homepage with clear pricing and easy add-to-cart actions reduces friction and encourages immediate purchases.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass3c8a1e90\"},{\"What\":\"Added a trust badges section highlighting free shipping, secure checkout, easy returns, and being trusted since 1999.\",\"Why\":\"Trust signals near the top of the page reduce purchase anxiety and address common customer objections, which increases conversion rates.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass5b2f8d44\"},{\"What\":\"Added a newsletter signup section offering 10% off the first order in exchange for an email address.\",\"Why\":\"Capturing email addresses with an incentive helps build a marketing list for remarketing and repeat purchases, increasing long-term revenue.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass6e1d4a88\"},{\"What\":\"Added a header with the site name/tagline and a navigation bar with links to Shop Featured, About Us, Newsletter, and Contact.\",\"Why\":\"Clear navigation helps visitors quickly find what they're looking for, reducing bounce rate and improving the likelihood of conversion.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass7f3a2b1c\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":null}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":11244,"completion_tokens":3734,"total_tokens":14978,"cost":0.059828,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.059828,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.022488,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.03734},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0},"server_tool_use_details":{"web_search_requests":0}}}
