s purchase hesitation and increases conversion rates, especially for studio bulk orders.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass4b1e6a2f\"},{\"What\":\"Added a prominent call-to-action button ('Shop Best Sellers') in the hero section linking to the featured products.\",\"Why\":\"A clear, visually distinct CTA above the fold guides visitors toward the shopping action immediately, reducing friction and increasing click-through to product pages.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass7f3a2c91\"},{\"What\":\"Added a trust badges row highlighting free shipping over $75, being trusted since 1999, 30-day easy returns, and bulk studio discounts.\",\"Why\":\"Surfacing key trust and value signals near the top of the page reduces perceived purchase risk and highlights incentives (free shipping, discounts) that are proven to increase average order value and conversion rates.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass9c5d3e18\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":null}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":11267,"completion_tokens":2883,"total_tokens":14150,"cost":0.051364,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.051364,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.022534,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.02883},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0},"server_tool_use_details":{"web_search_requests":0}}}
