team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p></section></main><footer class=\\\"site-footer\\\"><div class=\\\"footer-cols\\\"><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href=\\\"/mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/props\\\">Props</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/apparel\\\">Apparel</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Support</h4><ul><li><a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Contact Us</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">Shipping Info</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/returns\\\">Returns</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Company</h4><ul><li><a href=\\\"/about\\\">About Us</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Wholesale/Bulk</a></li></ul></div></div><p class=\\\"copyright\\\">&copy; 2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</p></footer></body></html>\",\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Added a hero section above the fold with a clear headline, supporting subtext, and two prominent call-to-action buttons ('Shop Best Sellers' and 'Get Studio Pricing').\",\"Why\":\"The original page only had a wall of about-us text with no visible product imagery, navigation, or CTAs. A hero section with clear CTAs immediately directs visitors toward purchasing paths, which is proven to reduce bounce rate and increase click-through to product pages.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass-2b7e4d9\"},{\"What\":\"Added a top announcement bar highlighting free shipping over $50 and a 30-day money-back guarantee.\",\"Why\":\"Shipping cost and return policy uncertainty are two of the top reasons for cart abandonment. Surfacing these trust signals immediately reduces purchase anxiety and increases conversion likelihood.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass-8f3a2c1\"},{\"What\":\"Added a trust bar with four key value propositions: 25+ years in business, free shipping threshold, bulk/studio discounts, and 30-day returns.\",\"Why\":\"Highlighting credibility markers and unique selling points near the top of the page builds buyer confidence quickly, especially for new visitors unfamiliar with the brand, which increases the likelihood of continued browsing and purchase.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass-6a1f5b3\"},{\"What\":\"Introduced a Featured Products grid with product images, names, discounted pricing (with strikethrough original price), and 'Add to Cart' buttons.\",\"Why\":\"The original page mentioned 'Featured Products' as a heading but had no actual product listings. Showing real products with visible discounts and a direct add-to-cart action removes friction and gives visitors an immediate path to purchase, directly driving revenue.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass-9c4d8e2\"},{\"What\":\"Added a customer social proof / testimonials section with 5-star ratings and quotes from studio owners and verified buyers.\",\"Why\":\"Social proof is one of the strongest conversion levers for e-commerce; showcasing positive reviews from studio owners and repeat buyers builds trust and reduces perceived purchase risk for new visitors.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass-1e5c7a4\"},{\"What\":\"Added an email signup section offering 15% off the first order in exchange for an email address.\",\"Why\":\"Capturing email leads with an immediate incentive grows a remarketing list and converts undecided visitors into future customers, increasing lifetime revenue even if they don't purchase on the first visit.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass-4d9b6f8\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":null}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":17140,"completion_tokens":3840,"total_tokens":20980,"cost":0.07268,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.07268,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.03428,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.0384},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0},"server_tool_use_details":{"web_search_requests":0}}}
