1; border: 2px solid #2f6e51; padding: 14px 30px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; transition: background .2s ease, transform .2s ease; }\\n  .btn-secondary:hover { background:#eef7f0; transform: translateY(-2px); }\\n  .featured { padding: 60px 40px; }\\n  .featured h2 { text-align:center; font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 32px; color:#204d38; }\\n  .product-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px,1fr)); gap: 24px; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }\\n  .product-card { border:1px solid #eee; border-radius:8px; padding:20px; text-align:center; }\\n  .product-card img { width:100%; height:160px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:6px; margin-bottom:12px; background:#f0f0f0; }\\n  .about { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 40px; text-align:center; }\\n  .about h2 { font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 20px; color:#204d38; }\\n  .about p { font-size: 16px; color:#4a4a4a; }\\n  footer { background:#204d38; color:#fff; padding: 40px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; }\\n</style></head><body>\\n<header>\\n  <div class=\\\"logo\\\">YogaDirect</div>\\n  <nav><ul>\\n    <li><a href=\\\"/mats\\\">Mats</a></li>\\n    <li><a href=\\\"/props\\\">Props</a></li>\\n    <li><a href=\\\"/apparel\\\">Apparel</a></li>\\n    <li><a href=\\\"/about\\\">About</a></li>\\n    <li><a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Contact</a></li>\\n  </ul></nav>\\n</header>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"HDLmClass7f3a1c9e\\\">\\n  <h1>Premium Yoga Gear for Every Practice, Every Budget</h1>\\n  <p class=\\\"subheadline\\\">High-quality mats, blocks, straps, and props—manufactured and sourced directly so you get studio-grade equipment at prices that make sense. Trusted by practitioners and studios since 1999.</p>\\n  <div class=\\\"hero-ctas\\\">\\n    <a href=\\\"/mats\\\" class=\\\"btn-primary\\\">Shop Yoga Mats</a>\\n    <a href=\\\"/props\\\" class=\\\"btn-secondary\\\">Explore Props</a>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"featured\\\">\\n  <h2>Featured Products</h2>\\n  <div class=\\\"product-grid\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"product-card\\\"><img src=\\\"mat1.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Premium Yoga Mat\\\"><h3>Premium Yoga Mat</h3><p>$29.99</p></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"product-card\\\"><img src=\\\"block1.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Foam Yoga Block\\\"><h3>Foam Yoga Block</h3><p>$9.99</p></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"product-card\\\"><img src=\\\"strap1.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Cotton Yoga Strap\\\"><h3>Cotton Yoga Strap</h3><p>$7.99</p></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"product-card\\\"><img src=\\\"bolster1.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Yoga Bolster\\\"><h3>Yoga Bolster</h3><p>$34.99</p></div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about\\\">\\n  <h2>Our Story</h2>\\n  <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  &copy; 2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.\\n</footer>\\n</body></html>\", \"improvements\": [{\"What\": \"Added a clear hero section with a value proposition headline, supporting subheadline, and two prominent call-to-action buttons (Shop Yoga Mats, Explore Props)\", \"Why\": \"A hero section with a strong headline, supporting subheadline, and prominent CTAs immediately communicates the site's value and guides visitors toward key product categories, increasing click-through and conversion rates.\", \"Hash\": \"HDLmClass7f3a1c9e\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":null}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":17691,"comp