usiness or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"HDLmClass_trustIcons HDLmClass1c4d7a2\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"trust-icon\\\"><div class=\\\"icon\\\">🚚</div>Free Shipping Over $50</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"trust-icon\\\"><div class=\\\"icon\\\">↩️</div>30-Day Returns</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"trust-icon\\\"><div class=\\\"icon\\\">🔒</div>Secure Checkout</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"trust-icon\\\"><div class=\\\"icon\\\">🏆</div>Trusted Since 1999</div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"HDLmClass_newsletter HDLmClass8b2e5f9\\\">\\n  <h2>Join the YogaDirect Community</h2>\\n  <p>Sign up for exclusive deals, new product launches, and 10% off your first order.</p>\\n  <div class=\\\"newsletter-form\\\">\\n    <input type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Enter your email address\\\">\\n    <button>Get 10% Off</button>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <p>&copy; 2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</p>\\n  <a href=\\\"#\\\">Contact Us</a> | <a href=\\\"#\\\">Shipping Info</a> | <a href=\\\"#\\\">Returns</a> | <a href=\\\"#\\\">Privacy Policy</a>\\n</footer>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\", \"improvements\": [{\"What\": \"Added a sticky trust bar at the top of the page highlighting free shipping, brand heritage since 1999, and easy returns\", \"Why\": \"Displaying key trust signals and shipping incentives prominently and persistently reduces cart abandonment and builds buyer confidence before customers even scroll, increasing conversion rates\", \"Hash\": \"HDLmClass9f3a2c1\"}, {\"What\": \"Added an urgency banner announcing a limited-time 20% off promotion on yoga mats\", \"Why\": \"Time-limited discount messaging creates a sense of urgency and scarcity, which is proven to drive faster purchase decisions and increase conversion rates\", \"Hash\": \"HDLmClass7d1e4b8\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a clear, high-contrast primary call-to-action button ('Shop Best Sellers Now') in the hero section\", \"Why\": \"A prominent, action-oriented CTA button guides visitors toward the next step immediately, reducing friction and increasing click-through to product pages\", \"Hash\": \"HDLmClass2a6f9c3\"}, {\"What\": \"Added social proof text ('Rated 4.8/5 by over 25,000 happy yogis') above the featured products grid\", \"Why\": \"Social proof such as ratings and customer counts builds credibility and trust, which has been shown to significantly increase conversion rates on e-commerce sites\", \"Hash\": \"HDLmClass5e8b1d0\"}, {\"What\": \"Added 'Add to Cart' buttons directly on each product card in the featured products grid\", \"Why\": \"Allowing one-click add-to-cart actions directly from the browsing view reduces the number of steps to purchase, lowering friction and increasing conversion rates\", \"Hash\": \"HDLmClass2a6f9c3\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a trust icon row (Free Shipping, 30-Day Returns, Secure Checkout, Trusted Since 1999) within the About/Our Story section\", \"Why\": \"Visually reinforcing key purchase-risk reducers near brand storytelling content helps overcome final purchase objections, increasing conversion rates\", \"Hash\": \"HDLmClass1c4d7a2\"}, {\"What\": \"Added an email newsletter signup section offering 10% off the first order in exchange for an email address\", \"Why\": \"Capturing email addresses with an immediate discount incentive grows the marketing list for remarketing and converts undecided visitors into future customers, increasing lifetime revenue\", \"Hash\": \"HDLmClass8b2e5f9\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":null}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":17661,"completion_tokens":5271,"total_tokens":22932,"cost":0.088032,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.088032,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.035322,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.05271},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens