t Us</a></li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"/assets/images/hero-banner.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Practice yoga anywhere with Yoga Direct\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-content\\\">\\n        <h1>Everything You Need for Your Yoga Practice</h1>\\n        <p>High-quality mats, props, and gear at prices that make sense.</p>\\n        <a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\">Shop Yoga Mats</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"featured-products\\\">\\n      <h2>Featured Products</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"product-grid\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"/products/premium-yoga-mat\\\">\\n            <img src=\\\"/assets/images/product-mat-1.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Premium Yoga Mat\\\">\\n            <h3>Premium Yoga Mat</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"price\\\">$29.99</p>\\n          </a>\\n          <button class=\\\"btn btn-secondary\\\">Add to Cart</button>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"/products/cork-yoga-block\\\">\\n            <img src=\\\"/assets/images/product-block-1.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Cork Yoga Block\\\">\\n            <h3>Cork Yoga Block</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"price\\\">$14.99</p>\\n          </a>\\n          <button class=\\\"btn btn-secondary\\\">Add to Cart</button>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"/products/yoga-strap\\\">\\n            <img src=\\\"/assets/images/product-strap-1.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Yoga Strap\\\">\\n            <h3>Yoga Strap</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"price\\\">$9.99</p>\\n          </a>\\n          <button class=\\\"btn btn-secondary\\\">Add to Cart</button>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"/products/yoga-mat-bag\\\">\\n            <img src=\\\"/assets/images/product-bag-1.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Yoga Mat Bag\\\">\\n            <h3>Yoga Mat Bag</h3>\\n            <p class=\\\"price\\\">$19.99</p>\\n          </a>\\n          <button class=\\\"btn btn-secondary\\\">Add to Cart</button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"company-story\\\">\\n      <h2 class=\\\"HDLmClass36daff0f\\\">Our Story</h2>\\n      <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n      <a href=\\\"/about-us\\\" class=\\\"HDLmClass36daff0f learn-more-link\\\">Learn more about our story &raquo;</a>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"newsletter\\\">\\n      <h2>Join Our Community</h2>\\n      <p>Sign up for exclusive deals, new product launches, and yoga tips delivered to your inbox.</p>\\n      <form action=\\\"/newsletter/subscribe\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n        <input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Enter your email address\\\" required>\\n        <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\">Subscribe</button>\\n      </form>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer class=\\\"site-footer\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"footer-columns\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"footer-col\\\">\\n        <h4>Shop</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-props\\\">Yoga Props</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-bags\\\">Yoga Bags</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-apparel\\\">Apparel</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"footer-col\\\">\\n        <h4>Company</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/about-us\\\">About Us</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/contact-us\\\">Contact Us</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/careers\\\">Careers</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"footer-col\\\">\\n        <h4>Customer Service</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">Shipping Info</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/returns\\\">Returns</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/faq\\\">FAQ</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"footer-col\\\">\\n        <h4>Follow Us</h4>\\n        <ul class=\\\"social-links\\\">\\n          <li><a href=\\\"https://facebook.com/yogadirect\\\">Facebook</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"https://instagram.com/yogadirect\\\">Instagram</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"https://twitter.com/yogadirect\\\">Twitter</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <p class=\\\"copyright\\\">&copy; 2025 Yoga Direct. All rights reserved.</p>\\n  </footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n\",\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Renamed the duplicate 'Featured Products' heading in the company story section to 'Our Story' and added a link to the full About Us page.\",\"Why\":\"The heading duplicated the 'Featured Products' label already used for the product grid above it, which confused visitors and diluted the brand story; renaming it to 'Our Story' and linking to the full About Us page clarifies the section's purpose, builds trust, and drives deeper engagement with the brand narrative, which can improve conversion.\",\"Hash\": \"HDLmClass36daff0f\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":"I'll start by retrieving the content from that URL.The web_fetch tool returned plain text instead of the raw HTML I need. Since there's no internet access in the sandbox except through web_fetch, I should try examining the full result object to see what content types a